of potentially involved Debian developers.

In future if you have questions like this please always bring this up on
the public mailing list debian-r at lists.debian.org.  You can also try to
write a bug report, but private mail should be only used for private
issues.  I'll try to bring your issue up in Enlish on the mailing list
to have a public record of it.

Kurt noticed that r-base 4.2.2 does not migrate to testing due to a
regression inside the test suite of r-cran-slicer[1].  The test failures
are occuring upstream as well[2].

